      "source": "https://ui.spectrumhq.in/r/bento-grid.json",
      "allowInlineGeometry": true,
      "reason": "Inline style spread carries measured mouse-tilt/spotlight motion values (rotateX/rotateY driven by pointer position) — geometry only, no colour in the inline style attribute itself. Noted for future review: the className also carries a Tailwind arbitrary-value hex colour (dark:bg-[#0C0C0C], line 137); that is a plain className string, not a parsed inline style or CSS declaration, so it is already exempt under the project's Tailwind-in-spectrumui/ui exemption and does not itself require this waiver."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/spectrumui/spotlight.tsx",
      "sha256": "944b63aec0aa5185f2c3cfad38565ac9d50e91743a0ba7ed9867524c33927ff1",
      "source": "https://ui.spectrumhq.in/r/bento-grid.json",
      "allowInlineGeometry": true,
      "reason": "style={{background}} is a measured pointer-follow radial-gradient position (mouseX/mouseY motion values via useMotionTemplate); its default colour stop is a hardcoded RGBA literal (color=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)\", line 20) that flows into the same exempted inline style attribute rather than a design token — this waiver covers both the pointer geometry and that non-token colour."
    },
