      "adaptations": "2026-09-12: list reset (list-none m-0 p-0) on SidebarMenu/SidebarMenuSub <ul> and m-0 p-0 on their <li> because this app ships Tailwind without Preflight. 2026-09-12 (sidebar restyle, owner: \"styles in the post-login menu links are terrible, wrong menu styles\"): SidebarMenu gap-0 -> gap-1 (4px item gap, brief's Layout section); sidebarMenuButtonVariants base gains [&_svg]:opacity-80 with data-active:[&_svg]:opacity-100 (icons at reduced opacity except the active item's, brief's Colour section) and data-active:shadow-[inset_2px_0_0_0_var(--sidebar-primary)] (the 2px left rail, the only accent color in the rail, kept as a box-shadow rather than an absolutely-positioned pseudo-element so it is not clipped by the button's own overflow-hidden and still respects rounded-md); base weight stays 400 and only data-active:font-medium goes to 500, so weight keeps distinguishing the active item as the brief requires."
